WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.770
Soon the first pack of monsters reached the woods.

2
00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:08.447
Up ahead, Ben could see Brunhilda limping.

3
00:00:08.448 --> 00:00:13.170
A minute later she ran off the course, dropping out of the race.

4
00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:18.878
"Hmm," Ben thought. That seemed suspicious, but what could he do?

5
00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:24.116
Besides, Mog had told his team to keep moving, no matter what.

6
00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:27.672
As they entered the woods, Gaby slowed down.

7
00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:31.656
She kept banging her head on the tree branches. "Ouch!"

8
00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:35.740
Then Lon, who'd had a quick start, began to tire.

9
00:00:35.741 --> 00:00:38.540
Zork and Mog quickly passed him.

10
00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:40.480
Ben zoomed through the woods.

11
00:00:40.481 --> 00:00:43.433
He was able to float right through tree branches.

12
00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:47.707
But Cleo's wrapping seemed to get snagged every few feet.

13
00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:51.105
"She's never going to catch up to me," Ben realized.

14
00:00:51.106 --> 00:00:55.422
"Now it's just Zork and Carly against me, Mog, and Deb.

15
00:00:55.423 --> 00:00:58.119
Team Black can totally win this race!"

16
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:03.481
The two doppelgangers were running right behind Ben, both looking winded.

17
00:01:03.482 --> 00:01:07.332
Abruptly Mog halted, clutching his leg.

18
00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:11.016
"I pulled a muscle. Catch Zork, Ben!"

19
00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:14.879
"I will!" Ben shot forward, determined to take the lead.

20
00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.460
By now Ben could see the clearing ahead—and the last part of the trail.

21
00:01:19.461 --> 00:01:21.901
He wasn't too far behind Zork.

22
00:01:21.902 --> 00:01:35.807
Once they were out of the woods, he could put on a last burst of speed and make it to the finish line first. Ben

23
00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:41.121
surged ahead, keeping the focus on his own pace, rather than Zork's. Near

24
00:01:41.122 --> 00:01:46.732
the finish line he could see Brunhilda, her ankle wrapped in bandages. Miss

25
00:01:46.733 --> 00:01:51.953
Bungle was rushing toward her, with Winnie and Serena racing after her. "Zork,

26
00:01:51.954 --> 00:01:55.283
look!" Ben pointed toward the witches. When

27
00:01:55.284 --> 00:01:58.887
Zork saw Brunhilda, his eyes went wide. "Ompf!"

28
00:01:58.888 --> 00:02:02.470
He tripped over his tail and pitched forward. Now

29
00:02:02.471 --> 00:02:04.973
Ben knew he could do it. Zooming

30
00:02:04.974 --> 00:02:09.580
forward, he sailed across the finish line. Students

31
00:02:09.581 --> 00:02:15.509
began cheering, and the cheerleaders waved their black pom-poms. "Yes!"

32
00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.053
Ben cried, collapsing on the ground. Mr.

33
00:02:19.054 --> 00:02:21.520
Gwarg spoke into a megaphone. "Team

34
00:02:21.521 --> 00:02:27.804
Black has won the cross-country event, tying the overall score. The

35
00:02:27.805 --> 00:02:34.891
next monster who crosses the finish line will win the championship for his or her team!" Ben

36
00:02:34.892 --> 00:02:39.755
lifted his head to look toward the woods. "Oh

37
00:02:39.756 --> 00:02:45.264
no!" he murmured. Carly was racing toward the finish line. Fans

38
00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:50.524
of Team Orange erupted in loud cheers as she crossed it. Mr.

39
00:02:50.525 --> 00:02:55.049
Freaky's noses wiggled with excitement. "Team

40
00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:58.299
Orange is our new Field Day champion. But

41
00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.935
let's cheer for both teams. Remember

42
00:03:00.936 --> 00:03:06.707
our Monster Academy motto—if you had fun, you won!" Ben

43
00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:09.700
sat up, staring at Carly. Something

44
00:03:09.701 --> 00:03:12.257
was wrong, he thought. Then

45
00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:16.560
he realized what it was—Carly wasn't wearing an orange shirt. Her

46
00:03:16.561 --> 00:03:18.289
shirt was black .

47
00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:22.601
Zork zipped over the finish line, followed by another runner.

48
00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:25.577
"That's Carly too!" Ben cried.

49
00:03:25.578 --> 00:03:32.303
The first Carly flashed a grin at Ben and quickly shifted shapes. "Deb!" he cried.

50
00:03:32.304 --> 00:03:36.452
"Carly was using kangaroo feet again," Deb explained.

51
00:03:36.453 --> 00:03:41.915
"So I decided to use my abilities too. I changed my face—"

52
00:03:41.916 --> 00:03:48.050
"Because you knew that Brunhilda would be confused and wouldn't risk sabotaging the real Carly!"

53
00:03:48.051 --> 00:03:55.025
"Yep!" Deb grinned. "It was worth a try—and it worked great."

54
00:03:55.026 --> 00:04:00.493
With help from Winnie and Serena, Team Black explained everything to the adults.

55
00:04:00.494 --> 00:04:09.656
Miss Bungle was still speaking sternly with Brunhilda, who was sobbing loudly.

56
00:04:09.657 --> 00:04:15.686
"Correction, everyone!" Mr. Freaky ran to the center of the field, flapping his arms.

57
00:04:15.687 --> 00:04:18.445
"There's been a mistake, but don't worry.

58
00:04:18.446 --> 00:04:24.663
Field Day is completely under control!

59
00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.562
Team Black is our winner."

60
00:04:27.563 --> 00:04:34.138
Wild cheers rang out as Team Black did a celebration dance on the field.

61
00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:38.377
*** When school was over for the day, Ben found Winnie at her locker.

62
00:04:38.378 --> 00:04:42.474
She smiled at him. "Congratulations again!"

63
00:04:42.475 --> 00:04:45.383
"Thanks." Ben was smiling too.

64
00:04:45.384 --> 00:04:50.948
"It feels pretty great to be a Field Day champion."

65
00:04:50.949 --> 00:04:55.784
"I heard that Brunhilda and Zork are in big trouble," Winnie said.

66
00:04:55.785 --> 00:04:59.594
"They were the only ones on Team Orange who cheated."

67
00:04:59.595 --> 00:05:04.336
"It's a good thing that you and Serena noticed something weird was going on," Ben said.

68
00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:07.568
"Speaking of weird." Winnie looked down.

69
00:05:07.569 --> 00:05:09.973
"Sorry that I've been acting strange.

70
00:05:09.974 --> 00:05:12.716
My cousin causes so much commotion.

71
00:05:12.717 --> 00:05:16.728
It's not easy being around such a beautiful witch."

72
00:05:16.729 --> 00:05:19.280
"Yes, it is!" Ben blurted out.

73
00:05:19.281 --> 00:05:21.327
Winnie looked up with a smile.

74
00:05:21.328 --> 00:05:24.688
But before she could reply, Mog came rushing up.

75
00:05:24.689 --> 00:05:30.661
"Guys! We need to say thank you to Serena for helping Team Black win Field Day.

76
00:05:30.662 --> 00:05:32.556
She's right over there."

77
00:05:32.557 --> 00:05:34.667
Ben looked down the hallway.

78
00:05:34.668 --> 00:05:41.398
As usual, Serena was surrounded by lots of monsters, all trying desperately to impress her.

79
00:05:41.399 --> 00:05:45.170
"I doubt we'll be able to get her attention right now, Mog."

80
00:05:45.171 --> 00:05:48.824
"We're the new Field Day champions," Mog said.

81
00:05:48.825 --> 00:05:53.411
"So everybody should be paying attention to us, not her!"

82
00:05:53.412 --> 00:06:00.038
Ben laughed, and to his delight, so did Winnie.

83
00:06:00.039 --> 00:06:11.029
"Come on," she said. "Let's go talk to her."

